Assume a defensive mental state.

For one turn, you will fully block the next melee attack used against you with your telekinetically-wielded weapon and then strike the attacker with it for [90%, 97%, 102%, 106%, 110% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

At talent level 3 you will also disarm the attacker for 3 turns.

At talent level 5 you will be able to reflexively block up to one attack per turn with a [5%, 11%, 18%, 24%, 29% (CUN 10-100)] chance, based on your cunning. Each trigger requires and uses 10 Psi.

This requires a telekinetically-wielded weapon.
